# Optional server-only setting. Unset uses info.
# Supported values: debug, info, warn, error, silent.
# Empty/unknown values are invalid; uncomment and fill deliberately.
# LOG_LEVEL=
# Optional DATABASE_URL: unset resolves to private data/vn30.sqlite in this project.
# Overrides require file: followed by an absolute private local path; see README.
# DATABASE_URL=
# No provider key or broker credential is required.
